(EventNote ev-20260902234805798477-q "Querying quirks: query_type/query_about/query_id default limit=20 (audits must pass explicit limit, e.g. limit=1000000). index_view head-truncates at limit_chars so the TAIL (newest clusters) is dropped under truncation - callers wanting the tail should request a large index then slice. Supersedes mechanism exists: new cluster id with (Supersedes new-id old-id); superseded event ids are excluded from index_view and status queries. Duplicate cluster id redeclaration is rejected at append time (ValidationError) - revision requires a fresh cluster id.")
(EvidenceSupportCount fact-store-api-quirks 156)
