(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260905T050024Z "ECAN TUNING (21:59): STI_FUNDS_BUFFER analysis done — current 90000 is fine, wage stays flat (20.0) for buffers 50k-90k. Running evidence boost differential test: belief with 5 evidence sources vs belief with 0, under default params, with boost=0 vs boost=5. Testing if boost creates meaningful survival differential. Full suite verification running in parallel.")
    (EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260905T050024Z ev-fact-ecan-integration)
    (EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260905T050024Z ev-ep-note-20260905T050538Z)
