(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260905T050109Z)
(About ep-note-20260905T050109Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260905T050109Z "ECAN TUNING (22:00): CRITICAL FINDING — EVIDENCE_STI_BOOST is a NO-OP. boost=0.0 and boost=5.0 produce identical STI values. _apply_evidence_boost() is not having any effect. However, differential already exists: b_ev (5 evidence sources) reaches ~55k STI vs b_no at ~2.5k after 200 cycles even with boost=0. The importance diffusion in the cycle itself already prioritizes evidence-backed beliefs. Investigating why _apply_evidence_boost is a no-op — likely stimulate() not working or wrong evidence_map attribute. Full suite still PASS (927+215sub).")
    (EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260905T050109Z ev-fact-ecan-integration)
(EvidenceSupportCount ep-note-20260905T050109Z 11)
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260905T050109Z
;;; BEGIN MemoryCluster ep-note-20260905T050229Z
(MemoryCluster ep-note-20260905T050229Z)
(SchemaVersion ep-note-20260905T050229Z medium-memory-v1)
(ClusterType ep-note-20260905T050229Z Episode)
(ClusterSource ep-note-20260905T050229Z iter-experience)
(ClusterOpenedAt ep-note-20260905T050229Z 2026-09-05T05:02:29Z)
(Contains ep-note-20260905T050229Z ev-ep-note-20260905T050229Z)
(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260905T050229Z)
(About ep-note-20260905T050229Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260905T050229Z "ECAN TUNING (22:01): Evidence boost IS working (trace shows +500 STI/cycle to b_ev). But ECAN economy is self-balancing — boost drains shared funds, lowering wage for all atoms, so equilibrium is same for boost=0 and boost=5. Differential (b_ev>>b_no) comes from wage system's stimulate() interaction, not importance diffusion (which does NOT use _evidence_map). Considering: (1) direct STI injection bypassing wage multiplier, or (2) variable rent rates by evidence count. Full suite PASS.")
    (EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260905T050229Z ev-fact-ecan-integration)
(EvidenceSupportCount ep-note-20260905T050229Z 10)
