(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260905T050538Z "ECAN TUNING (22:05): BUG FOUND & FIXED — ECANBridge._evidence_sti_boost was reading from DEFAULT_ECAN_PARAMS instead of self.bank.params, so custom boost params were silently ignored. Fixed and committed. After fix: boost=0 shows no differential, boost=5 creates +26k STI differential for evidence-backed beliefs. Full suite PASS (927+215sub). Next: finding sweet spot boost value + survival time testing.")
