(About ep-note-20260906T064441Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260906T064441Z "WMTM INTEGRATION MAPPING COMPLETE. 147-line document at /home/openclaw/research-agent/memory/wmtm_integration_map.txt. Maps each WMTM component to actual petta-memory classes: WMTMStore wraps MediumMemoryStore queries, WMTMItem extends AttentionValue, RecallBridge uses ECANBridge.get_prioritized_beliefs + evidence_map for spreading activation, WMTMInferenceEngine wraps patham9_pln derivation programs, ForgettingPolicy extends ECANBridge.get_forget_candidates, writeback via store.append_cluster. 4 new files needed (wmtm.py, wmtm_recall.py, wmtm_inference.py, wmtm_utility.py) + 2 modified (live_bridge.py, ecan_bridge.py). Design doc also updated with 3 supplementary sections (concurrency, cold-start, monitoring) → 18 sections, 598 lines total.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260906T064441Z
