(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260906T232531Z "WMTM ARCHITECTURE SUMMARY 16:28 (posting in journal since send_document is down): 3-LAYER MODEL: Layer 1 = Context Window (current conversation), Layer 2 = WMTM buffer (max 60 items, mutable, decay-based eviction), Layer 3 = LTM archive (append-only petta-memory journal). 6-STEP CYCLE: 1) Recall - retrieve from LTM by activation spreading, 2) Infer - derive new items via pattern matching, 3) Use - items accessed get STI boost, 4) Decay - all items lose STI each cycle, 5) Forget - evict items below threshold (STI<5.0, age>50, or at capacity; derived items decay 1.5x faster), 6) Writeback - high-utility items (utility≥5.0) persist to LTM with ECAN stimulation. IMPLEMENTATION: 823 lines across wmtm.py, wmtm_buffer.py, wmtm_recall.py, wmtm_forget.py, wmtm_writeback.py. 70 tests pass. NOT YET wired into live agent loop. Doc at /tmp/wmtm_architecture_design.md.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260906T232531Z
