(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T025712Z "SEND CHANNEL ROOT CAUSE: send() requires exactly 1 file in processing/ dir (active Telegram request). When agent runs autonomously (NO NEW USER INPUT), processing/ is empty → ChannelContractError. This is by design (one-shot request-response channel). send_document.py has same issue. Workaround: Telegram Bot API directly. All WMTM work complete: 222 tests pass, 6/6 benchmark patterns, commit cc9d97e.")
