(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T054453Z "CONSOLIDATION CHAIN A — Identity Investigation Episode Link. Episodes ep-note-20260908T050117Z → ep-note-20260908T050206Z → ep-note-20260908T050236Z form a temporal chain: initial findings → complete findings → report delivery. ep-050236Z supersedes ep-050206Z (same conclusion, later timestamp, adds report location). Key consolidated finding: All three bots (ProtoCosmo, ProtoCosmo2, ProtoMegaBot2) use the same LLM model endpoint (mlx-community/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it-4bit). Channel isolation is enforced via ITER_OUTER_CHANNEL_ROOT + IDENTITY validation. The symmetric identity confusion in Telegram groups is caused by group psychology (same model + similar prompts + same context), NOT by channel isolation failure.")
