(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T054514Z "PROMOTION CANDIDATE 1 — Belief: Bot Identity Confusion Cause. Source episodes: ep-note-20260908T050117Z, ep-note-20260908T050206Z. Promoted belief: (BeliefContent bi-bot-confusion \"The symmetric identity confusion between ProtoCosmo2 and ProtoMegaBot2 in Telegram group chats is caused by group psychology: both bots see the same messages, use the same LLM model (mlx-community/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it-4bit), and have similar prompt.txt content. Channel isolation itself is strong (ITER_OUTER_CHANNEL_ROOT + IDENTITY validation).\") Strength: HIGH (confirmed by two independent investigation episodes). Confidence: HIGH (directly observed channel code and model config).")
